{"seq":3,"slug":"audience-and-community","title":"受众与社区","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-brand-building-in-public/audience-and-community","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"building-audience-from-zero","title":"从零建立受众","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-brand-building-in-public/audience-and-community/building-audience-from-zero","wordCount":3608,"readingTime":15},{"seq":2,"slug":"authentic-engagement-networking","title":"真实的互动与 networking","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-brand-building-in-public/audience-and-community/authentic-engagement-networking","wordCount":3467,"readingTime":14},{"seq":3,"slug":"audience-to-community","title":"从受众到社区","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/personal-brand-building-in-public/audience-and-community/audience-to-community","wordCount":3496,"readingTime":14}],"introMarkdown":"# 受众与社区 简介\n\n内容发出去,还要有人看、有人互动、最终形成连接——这就是受众与社区。本章讲清这一层:先是**从零建立受众**（冷启动的现实、怎么获得前 1000 个真正的粉丝、怎么利用你已有的网络起步），然后是**真实地互动与 networking**（通过回复、帮助他人、建立真实关系来成长,而非刷点赞数字),最后是**把受众变社区**（从单向的「我发你看」广播,走向双向的、有归属感的社区）。这一章的核心是:受众不是「数字」而是**真实的人**——靠真诚地互动、帮助、连接来积累,且最有价值的不是一大群冷漠的关注者,而是一个**真正在意你、彼此连接**的社区。把人当人,而非当增长指标。\n"}